---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "Shop — Dekoris"
pageDescription: "Shop Dekoris's premium blinds and curtains — Honeycomb, Roller, Zebra, Roman, Venetian, and more. Proudly Namibian, 100% female-owned."
activePage: shop
permalink: /shop/
---
  <style>
    .shop-intro {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 80px 40px 32px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .shop-intro-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .shop-intro .section-label {
      justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .shop-intro h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
      font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-dark);
      line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .shop-intro p {
      font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-body);
      line-height: 1.7; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .shop-section { background: var(--cream); padding: 56px 40px 100px; }
    .shop-grid {
      max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .shop-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .shop-section { padding: 40px 24px 80px; }
      .shop-intro { padding: 64px 24px 24px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .shop-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .shop-footnote {
      max-width: 720px; margin: 56px auto 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-light);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .shop-footnote a { color: var(--gold); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold-light); }
    .shop-footnote a:hover { color: var(--gold-dark); }
  </style>

  <section class="shop-intro">
    <div class="shop-intro-inner">
      <div class="section-label">Shop</div>
      <h1>Crafted for every window.</h1>
      <p>Honeycomb, Roller, Zebra, Roman, and Venetian blinds — available with no-drill or permanent installation options, and your choice of cordless, corded, or motorised control. Pricing shown is a starting point; final price depends on your window measurements.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shop-section">
    <div class="shop-grid">
      {% for product in collections.products %}
      <a class="product-card fade-up" href="/shop/{{ product.data.slug }}/" style="transition-delay: {{ loop.index0 * 0.05 }}s">
        <div class="product-image">
          <img src="{{ product.data.image }}" alt="{{ product.data.title }}">
        </div>
        <div class="product-info">
          <div class="product-name">{{ product.data.title }}</div>
          {% if product.data.slug != "curtains" %}
          <div class="product-badges">
            <span class="badge badge-nodrill">No-Drill</span>
            <span class="badge badge-motorised">Motorised</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="product-price"><span class="product-from">from</span>N${{ product.data.price | commaNumber }}</div>
          <span class="product-buy">View Sizes →</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="shop-footnote">
      Looking for something custom or want measurements done for you?
      <a href="/quote/">Request a quote</a> and we'll be in touch within 1-2 business days.
    </p>
  </section>

